Title: Every Rounded Conversion, Decimals Floats.
Note: LAW-SUFFICIENCY-1, E1. A research fixture, off the gate: the rounded conversions from a float literal.
§1 Decimals are floats.
§2 Let a be 2.5 rounded to an integer.
§3 Let b be 0.1 rounded to a fixed.
§4 Let c be 7 rounded to a float.
§5 Let d be 0.5 as a fixed rounded to a float.
§6 Say a.
§7 Say b.
§8 Say c.
§9 Say d.
